WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.502
-We want to play a game with you
because we found out that

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
one of your favorite
golf movies,

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
maybe even your favorite,
is "Happy Gilmore."

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.207
-It certainly is.
Everyone loves "Happy Gilmore."

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:09.342 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:09.943 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It is time for

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:13.079
the "Happy Gilmore Putting
Challenge" with Rory McIlroy.

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:18.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:18.885 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Now here's how it works.

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:21.888
Instead of using golf clubs,
we'll putt using a hockey stick

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:24.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
just like Adam Sandler did
in "Happy Gilmore."

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
In fact, there he is
right over there.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:27.494 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What's up, Sandman?

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're going to put 30 seconds
on the clock.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:33.199
Whoever makes more putts before
time runs out is the winner.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.734 line:92%
I'll be using the yellow balls.

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
You'll be using
the little white balls.

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:40.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Perfect.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ready for this?
-Ready.

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:44.644 line:92%
-All right. Time starts...now.

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:46.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
Go.
-Oh, no.

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:48.548 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.083 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh! Oh, no.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:54.054 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.288 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-One time.

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.623 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:58.124 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, no!

00:00:58.124 --> 00:01:01.294 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.997 size:88% position:44%
I'm going two at a time.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:10.403 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:12.005 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
No!

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:15.241 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.443 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:18.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Judges.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:19.612 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's a tie!

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:21.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No!
-Yes!

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:23.683 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I love that.

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:25.085 line:92%
I will keep that as a tie.

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:27.987 line:92%
My man Rory McIlroy, everybody.

